    'Tracking Event: Haohan Mudclaw is Farmhand‡Tracking Event: Haohan Mudclaw is Farmhand‡Verfolgungsereignis: Haohan Lehmkrall ist Landarbeiter‡이벤트 추적: 하오한 머드클로는 농장 일꾼‡Tracking Event: Haohan Zarpa Fangosa es jornalero‡‡Tracking Event: Haohan Mudclaw is Farmhand‡追踪事件：郝瀚·泥爪是名雇农‡',
