[31353] = {
  {
    'Tracking Event: Tina Mudclaw Exalted‡Tracking Event: Tina Mudclaw Exalted‡Tracking Event: Tina Mudclaw Exalted‡이벤트 추적: 티나 머드클로 확고한 동맹‡Evento de seguimiento: Tina Zarpa Fangosa exaltada‡‡Tracking Event: Tina Mudclaw Exalted‡跟踪事件：兴奋的迪娜·泥爪‡',
