    'FLAG - Hammer of the Poisoned Mind‡FLAG - Hammer of the Poisoned Mind‡FLAG - Hammer of the Poisoned Mind‡플래그 - 독한 마음의 망치‡FLAG - Martillo de la Mente Envenenada‡‡FLAG - Hammer of the Poisoned Mind‡旗帜——毒心之锤‡',
